OL,3,GNEWSA'Marathon man' among Make a
OL,4,ADifference heroes
OL,5,
OL,6,FCumbria's "marathon man", a brass band
OL,7,Fconductor, and an animal rescue charity
OL,8,Fwere among the winners at an award
OL,9,Fceremony celebrating people who had
OL,10,Fmade life better for others in their
OL,11,Fcommunities.
OL,13,FThe BBC Radio Cumbria Make a Difference
OL,14,Finitiative began during the Covid-19
OL,15,Fpandemic to connect those in need with
OL,16,Fthose who could help and continues to
OL,17,Fhighlight those making a difference.
OL,19,FWinners were announced in eight
OL,20,Fcategories, including being a "great
OL,21,Fneighbour" and a "young hero".
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
