OL,3,GNEWSA'Marathon man' among Make a
OL,4,ADifference heroes
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudges, including Barrow-born England
OL,7,Ffootballer Georgia Stanway, chose from
OL,8,Fthousands of nominations and the
OL,9,Fwinners were honoured at a ceremony at
OL,10,Fthe Halston Hotel in Carlisle on
OL,11,FSunday.
